  { q: "How often should I train legs?", a: "Most people do well with 2 leg sessions per week, leaving at least one rest day between hard lower-body workouts." },
  { q: "What muscles should a leg workout include?", a: "A balanced leg workout should train quads, hamstrings, glutes, calves, and hips. Squats and lunges emphasize quads and glutes, while Romanian deadlifts and leg curls emphasize hamstrings." },
